1-4|A pilgrim accidentally bumps a player-character.
5-11|Pilgrims are hiring an escort for a holy quest: see Table 29, the missions table, to determine particulars.
12-14|Player-characters see a pilgrim being hounded or mocked by street urchins.
15-16|Player-characters see a pilgrim being mugged by [[1d10]] muggers or thugs.
17|A pilgrim seeks others to accompany him on a pilgrimage.
18-19|Some pilgrims are lost, and ask directions from a player-character.
20|A pilgrim recognizes a player-character. Roll [[1d20]]: on a result of 1-10, the pilgrim is mistaken; on 11-20, the pilgrim correctly recognizes the player-character as a friend, enemy, etc.